#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""[msgthumb] Message view: an MP4 clip shows its thumbnail, then plays muted and looping as the
final display once its roll lands, the roll kept in view; an MP3 clip draws a falling-levels
LED meter with peak hold on a transparent canvas inside the bubble, driven by the RAW analyser
reading (precomputed levels from the clip itself where no analyser reaches); video detected from
the row (video / sfx_video_id / extension / frame thumb), else the poster road; the record bubble
gets its album art and its visualizer in a transparent row inside it, on the raw reading.

Targets (both, identical): desktop/renderer/script-page.js and
app/src/main/assets/pine-views/script-page.js (base 1f2a577: [msgonce] [msgsplit2] live).

  python edit_msgthumb_script_page.py --check <file>   exit 0 ready / 2 already applied / 1 missing (prints which)
  python edit_msgthumb_script_page.py --apply <file>
Marker-idempotent; CRLF-aware (normalised to LF to match, written back as found);
all anchors must be present exactly once or nothing is written.
"""
